## Conflict / Gate Assessment

🟢 **No conflict.** PrivacyWeave operates in commercial data governance — no defence, no government procurement, no SCOMET exposure. Engagement does not require clearance from a serving-officer standpoint.

**Gate recommendation:** Limited advisory (framing, India positioning, DPDP angle) is possible now. Active consulting engagement or equity/fee arrangement is cleaner post-May 2027 when conflict-of-interest exposure from serving status is eliminated.

